{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_027say_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_027say_009_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "edcf89ded65f424ce8ce3687b9a980050ce4f2b12ab654dcfc7964fe94a27ae3", "ja": "お誕生日おめでとー！", "zh": "生日快乐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_027say_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_027say_009_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "d5dfe39b3a34161c433d7f891d454e3f4014039397525f4e826afdc808e5e1b6", "ja": "さ、紗代子さんはいつも、自分の意志を持ってて……。\nそれを、貫くことができて……あ、憧れます……！", "zh": "纱代子总是有着自己的信念……而且还能坚持到底……我、我真的很向往……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_027say_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_027say_009_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "732ea4a0dc18546058720c9c1fac7db544e9cf67b7b47d049f8fad5fcf79856e", "ja": "紗代子はいつも、自分に嘘のない生き方をしているん\nですのね。そのままの紗代子でいてくださいまし。", "zh": "纱代子一直都在坚持以不欺骗自己的方式生活呢。请一直做那个原本的纱代子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_027say_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_027say_009_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "17331fc8a3e21a885c42d06e406bd9c81dc298525a93d8046650dd404d30be2a", "ja": "ふたりとも、ありがとう！　私、自分には自信ないけど\n……進んできた道は、間違いじゃないって信じてます！", "zh": "谢谢你们！虽然我对自己没有信心……\n但我相信，自己一路走来的路没有错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl_027say_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_027say_009_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c454140621ee335d5632611137b9797903004dfc81ed0ea2e4f8d74105d4161e", "ja": "紗代子、お疲れさま！\nそれから……。", "zh": "纱代子，辛苦了！\n还有就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
